# apps/runner

Job: write room files → `npm install --ignore-scripts` (network on, ~60s) → `node` with network off (~15s). Image `node:20-alpine`.

- Prefer Docker (`docker run`). If Docker is missing, local `npm`/`node` with the same timeouts — dev only, not a sandbox.
- No lifecycle scripts (`ignore-scripts`). No extra package registries.
- Stream stdout/stderr/status/exit as `JobEvent`. Kill the process tree on timeout (Windows: `taskkill /t`).
- Paths must stay inside the job directory; reject `..`.
- API talks to `RUNNER_URL` (default `http://127.0.0.1:4000`). Do not add Piston here.
